      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Unofficial example.** This project is an educational example of using Cursor's Admin and Analytics APIs. It is not an official Cursor product and not a chargeback or billing tool. Figures are estimates and can differ from Cursor's billing dashboard and invoices, for example because of plan-included usage or time zone boundaries. Verify them against Cursor's official billing before making any financial decision. The code is provided as is, without warranty or support."
      }
